{"document_id": "Corrigendum and letter Jun 12, 2023", "source_file": "Corrigendum and letter Jun 12, 2023.pdf", "page_start": 1, "page_end": 1, "heading_path": ["1 Chairman, NABARD"], "section": "1 Chairman, NABARD", "subsection": "1 Chairman, NABARD", "clause": "", "chunk_type": "text", "images": [], "text": "The undersigned is directed to refer to the subject mentioned above and to say that the guidelines for the Centrally Sponsored Project for Computerization of PACS were circulated to all the States/Union Territories (UTs) vide this Ministry's communication dated 2/1/2023/", "language": "en", "chunk_id": "Corrigendum and letter Jun 12, 2023_00004"}
{"document_id": "Corrigendum and letter Jun 12, 2023", "source_file": "Corrigendum and letter Jun 12, 2023.pdf", "page_start": 1, "page_end": 1, "heading_path": ["1 Chairman, NABARD"], "section": "1 Chairman, NABARD", "subsection": "1 Chairman, NABARD", "clause": "2", "chunk_type": "text", "images": [], "text": "2. As decided in the 3rd meeting of the National Level Monitoring and Implementation Committee (NLMIC) held on 6th June, 2023 under the chairmanship of Secretary (M/o Cooperation), the corrigendum to the clauses of the Project Guidelines, are enclosed herewith.", "language": "en", "chunk_id": "Corrigendum and letter Jun 12, 2023_00005"}
{"document_id": "Corrigendum and letter Jun 12, 2023", "source_file": "Corrigendum and letter Jun 12, 2023.pdf", "page_start": 1, "page_end": 1, "heading_path": ["1 Chairman, NABARD"], "section": "1 Chairman, NABARD", "subsection": "1 Chairman, NABARD", "clause": "4", "chunk_type": "text", "images": [], "text": "4. It is therefore, requested to kindly ensure that the revised clauses as per corrigendum dated 12.06.2023 are followed for implementation of the Computerization of PACS project along with other guidelines.", "language": "en", "chunk_id": "Corrigendum and letter Jun 12, 2023_00006"}
